'''Paperboy Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stage]] [[Invasion of Poultrio]] appearing on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''' and '''16th''' days of every month. He was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 851
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Paperboy Cat
|name2 = Bargain Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Bargain Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A fantastic [[Long Distance]] midrange rusher, boasting [[Insane Damage]] against [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]. Think of Paperboy Cat as a sort of [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] against his targets, rushing in to do sizable damage, especially if both hits connect—which they often will! Against targets at Lv.50, Bargain Cat does upwards of ''67,500 damage per attack cycle'', or ''14,780 effective DPS'', which is over two times higher than [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]]' at equal levels VS. Relics, and for a much lower cost. Because of this, it's worthwhile to stack him as much as you can if a stage allows it. Spammable attackers against Aku are few and far between, with his only rivals being [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N006 (Special Cat)|Fallen Bear Cat]], units lacking viability either through irrelevant crowd-control or extremely impractical applicability respectively.

Just as much Paperboy Cat's damage, his high range is immensely valuable for such a spammable rusher, especially in {{4c}} settings where not even [[Condemned Peng]]s or [[M. Ost]]s can hope to reach them. [[Immune to Surge|Immunity to Surge]] gives them good matchups VS. most Aku, and even facilitates usage against the [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]] or as a generalist unit against enemies like [[St. Dober]]. While his damage against non-targets is on the lower side, he makes up for it through sheer versatility, and is a worthwhile reward for slaying the [[Poultrio|three-headed beast]].

